"""Brand mono embedded as base64, so the scorecard renders in the same
typeface as quaesitor.eu with no network request.

The tool's promise is that the page fetches nothing from any host. An embedded
base64 font keeps that promise: it is part of the file, not a request. Only the
mono is embedded; the reading face is a system serif stack, exactly as the site
does it.

Font: JetBrains Mono, SIL Open Font License 1.1.
      https://github.com/JetBrains/JetBrainsMono
      The OFL permits bundling in and shipping with software; the license text
      should travel with the repository (see fonts/OFL.txt).
"""

